  'set.allowPrivate': 'Let users reach private / local addresses', 'set.allowPrivateHelp': 'Off by default: connections through the proxy to 127.0.0.1, 10/172.16/192.168 ranges and 169.254.169.254 (cloud metadata) are rejected, so users cannot reach services that listen only on loopback (such as the WARP port) or your LAN; public addresses of your servers are not blocked, so the panel, the external API and subscriptions work through the proxy. Turn on only if users must reach a private network; changing it restarts the data plane once and syncs to nodes',
