  'logs.enabled': 'Logging', 'logs.enabledHelp': 'When off, neither the data plane nor the panel writes logs (saves CPU/memory); turn it on when troubleshooting. Takes effect at once, no data-plane restart.', 'logs.coreLevel': 'Log level', 'logs.coreLevelHelp': 'warn (default): warnings and errors only, never slows connections. info: one line per connection, tens of thousands an hour; a disk hiccup on a node then stalls every connection, so enable it only while troubleshooting. debug: even more. Applies immediately.', 'logs.coreLevelSaved': 'Data-plane log level changed',
