  'ha.set.dnsHelp': 'After a takeover, A / AAAA records of these names that point to the former master\'s IP are switched to the new master (line, TTL and proxy status stay; other records are untouched). If the carried subscription certificate can\'t be used, it also issues a new one for the subscription domain. Failures only raise alerts and never block the takeover.',
